<title>USA: Sparta Foods sets distribution pact.</title>
<headline>Sparta Foods sets distribution pact.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sparta Foods Inc said Tuesday it signed an agreement to purchase certain equipment from Gerald's Foods Inc and also agreed to manufacture exclusively certain sauce products for Geraldo's.</p>
<p>No terms were released for the agreements. The sauce products covered in the agreement include salsa and guacamole.</p>
<p>&quot;This additional business provides an exciting opportunity to expand our product offerings in the sauce and salsa category and complements our primary tortilla product lines,&quot; Joel Bachul, Sparta president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
